    "body": "Add a BIP-352 test vector where a taproot input is spent via the key path with an annex (2-item witness). The annex must be stripped before deciding between key-path and script-path spends (see https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0341.mediawiki#script-validation-rules), so the input is still eligible and all expected values match the plain key-path case.",
