      "message": "tests: silentpayments: add taproot key-path spend with annex vector\n\nAdd a BIP-352 test vector where a taproot input is spent via the key\npath with an annex (2-item witness). The annex must be stripped before\ndeciding between key-path and script-path spends, so the input is still\neligible and all expected values match the plain key-path case.",
